  "body": "As discussed a bit in https://github.com/mikewest/internetdrafts/commit/d2e4cd80fc9417a4d4d2d74e7d9be2781454c972, the `First-Party-Only` cookie attribute requires tracking the originator of a request across navigations. That doesn't seem possible at the moment via Fetch's current definition.\n",
